  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1803.03 Review for Completeness",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1803.03 Review for Completeness.\n\n(a) The rivers coordinator shall review each nomination to determine whether the nomination is complete.\n\n(b) The rivers coordinator shall determine that the nomination is complete if it contains all of the information and documentation required by Env-Wq 1803.01 and Env-Wq 1803.02.\n\n(c) Within 30 days of the submission of the nomination, the rivers coordinator shall notify the sponsor as to whether the nomination is complete or incomplete.\n\n(d) If the rivers coordinator determines that the nomination is incomplete, the rivers coordinator shall request the sponsor to provide the missing information, and the nomination shall not be deemed complete until such information is provided.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1800) #8326, eff 4-21-05; ss by #9330, eff 11-26-08; ss by #12185, eff 5-25-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1800.html"
